libkolab decides "my calendar" vs "someone else's" by comparing the DAV owner with
the IMAP login. With an external DAV server whose account has another name, every
calendar looked shared and invitations had nowhere to be saved. mailhub_dav sets
kolab_dav_owner to the connected DAV user. Worth proposing upstream (Kolab).

